// set05 corpus entry
// source_repo: fmzquant-strategies
// source_path: fmzquant-strategies/高级动态追踪止损与目标盈利策略-Advanced-Dynamic-Trailing-Stop-with-Risk-Reward-Targeting-Strategy.md
